ication version, Windows version, system architecture, device identifier, and relevant error details. The support flow does not send document names, document paths, document contents, extracted text, or full OCR results unless the user deliberately includes them in a support message or screenshot."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Payments"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"When paid checkout is enabled, payment-card information will be collected and processed by the payment provider shown at checkout. RoutineOff will not store complete payment-card numbers or security codes. We may receive subscription, invoice, payment-status, and billing-contact information required to provide the subscription, issue receipts, resolve billing issues, and meet legal obligations."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Retention and security"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Account information will be retained only while needed to provide the subscription, keep required records, resolve disputes, and protect the service. Reasonable technical safeguards will be used, but no system can guarantee absolute security."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Your choices"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Customers may request correction or deletion of account information where applicable. Contact ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:Mohamed95Hassan12@gmail.com","children":"Mohamed95Hassan12@gmail.com"}]," for privacy or account requests. We may retain limited records when required to provide the service, comply with law, resolve disputes, or protect the service from abuse."]}]]}]]}],["$","footer",null,{"className":"_footer_rrnft_83","children":["© 2026 RoutineOff · United Arab Emirates · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:Mohamed95Hassan12@gmail.com","children":"Support"}]]}]]}]]
